  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-028 (Phase 3 — engine / Parsing (`HFRParsing`)): AQ listing and AQ RSS feed parsers (the AQ part of LOT-025 (#53)), HTML entities decoded.\n\n### Scope\n\nAQ listing and AQ RSS feed parsers (the AQ part of LOT-025 (#53)), HTML entities decoded\n\n- Module: HFRParsing · Difficulty: easy · Priority: low\n- Audit source: D6, B4\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-020 (#48), LOT-012 (#45)\n\n### Blocked by\n\ncapture #133 (AQ listing `getAlertesByTopic` and AQ RSS feed, `host: mac`, open; maintainer comment of 2026-10-28: \"This lot stays blocked until it lands\"). Dependencies LOT-020 (#48) and LOT-012 (#45) are done.\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet → Opus\n\n### Spec\n\n- [docs/lots/LOT-028-aq-parsers.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-028-aq-parsers.md)\n\n### PRs\n\nNone recorded.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n—\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-aq-listing-and-aq-rss-feed (#133)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `blocked (AQ capture)`.\n",
